# Metadata for the data-v1.1.0 release; the earlier Zenodo DOI is distinct.
cff-version: 1.2.0
type: dataset
message: >-
  If you use this collection, cite this version and its release URL.
  The earlier Zenodo DOI identifies the historical 1.0.0 archive and is not
  the DOI of this collection.
title: >-
  Data and code for size-dependent flexural band gaps and fixed-area shape
  design of periodic composite microplates
version: 1.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Xin
    affiliation: Department of Bioresource Engineering, McGill University
  - family-names: Cai
    given-names: Jun
    affiliation: Department of Bioresource Engineering, McGill University
  - family-names: Kalamkarov
    given-names: Alex
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Bioresource Engineering, McGill University;
      Department of Mechanical Engineering, Dalhousie University
  - family-names: Akbarzadeh
    given-names: Abdolhamid
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Bioresource Engineering, McGill University;
      Department of Mechanical Engineering, McGill University
url: https://github.com/Slight1211/mcst-tsdt-pwe/releases/tag/data-v1.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Slight1211/mcst-tsdt-pwe
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
abstract: >-
  Numerical data and computational sources for flexural-wave spectra,
  modal sensitivities, fixed-area inclusion-boundary optimization and
  selected three-dimensional comparisons in periodic composite microplates.
  The collection includes figure and table data, five optimized interfaces
  at prescribed epoxy material lengths, source records, file checksums and
  reproduction tools. Data, figures and documentation use CC BY 4.0;
  original executable source uses MIT, as detailed in LICENSES.md.
keywords:
  - phononic crystals
  - modified couple stress theory
  - plane wave expansion
  - flexural band gaps
  - modal sensitivity
  - shape optimization
  - microplates
